{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Escanoteca 是一款結合手寫筆記清理與文件掃描的工具，適合學生、會議記錄者及需要整理紙本文件的人士。它可透過 AI 讀取手寫內容，修正拼寫並在原位重寫每行文字，同時保留圖表、箭頭與簽名；亦具備自動裁切、離線 OCR 及多格式匯出能力。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-276.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>手寫辨識與文件掃描</h2>\n<p>使用時可先拍攝課堂筆記、會議記錄或手寫信件，系統會自動偵測頁面、拉直及裁切，並在本機辨識英文、西班牙文等多種語言的文字。AI 會逐行校正錯字，或按需要保留逐字版本，再用六種手寫風格字體於原位重寫，圖表、箭頭與簽名則直接複製。完成後可匯出 PDF、Word、Markdown、Excel 等格式，亦可選擇朗讀文字。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-285-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-286-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-287-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-288-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-289-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-290-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Escanoteca</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/escanoteca/id6834589454?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:04:17.191678+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T21:38:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:54:31.916396+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T21:57:45.507453+00:00","content_hash":"5e0f5347d58674a98569d6a4e22b85d6bdd96850f6443c0ed023ed463a8d970c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}